2E FORTH OS - GETTING AROUND

AT THE PROMPT

CAT          LIST THIS DISK
HELP         SUMMARY OF THE WORDS
WORDS        EVERY DEFINITION
SEE NAME     DECOMPILE ONE
UNUSED .     DICTIONARY BYTES LEFT

FILES        N IS THE NUMBER CAT PRINTS

N LOAD       COMPILE A FORTH SOURCE FILE
N LOCK       LOCK OR UNLOCK
N DEL        DELETE (REFUSED IF LOCKED)
N REN        RENAME
ADDR LEN SAVE   WRITE A TEXT FILE

SCREENS

HGR          560X192 MONOCHROME
GR           40X48 IN SIXTEEN COLOURS
TEXT         BACK TO THE CONSOLE

A DEMO FILE PRINTS WHAT TO TYPE WHEN IT
LOADS, AND NAMES A MARKER WORD.  FORGET
THAT MARKER TO GET THE SPACE BACK.
